     <h2>How this list is made</h2>
     <p>A scraper runs at 6 AM and 3 PM IST against each company's own careers site (Workday, Greenhouse, Lever, Oracle and similar). Titles match on data-engineering roles (Data Engineer, Analytics Engineer, Big Data, Software Engineer – Data and the reverse word order) or a skill word in the title (Spark, PySpark, Hadoop, ETL, Databricks, Airflow, dbt, Snowflake, data warehouse or pipeline). Abbreviations such as Sr., Eng. and Dev are expanded first. Locations include neighbourhoods (Hinjewadi, Kharadi, Powai, Goregaon, Airoli and others) and remote roles open in India. Internships, data-centre, data-entry and data-scientist roles are left out.</p>
